    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Christine Booth",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106342285895273802320/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLHn8U6Xq5JzMfYpkli6_v5KSPeg1lV_MOM8lal2nL8zsGZjw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Elise is so genuine, kind, and professional.\nHer lash lifts are incredible! I’ve tried many different locations over the years and Elise is by far the best. I cannot recommend her enough!",
        "time": 1764719936,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andria",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102113726682087806307/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdZgYbgHAWc_ftAx1OPXfDueGkvrDatxEw8p4JhnSuJZlSiw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I recently went to have my hydrofacial done Elise and it was amazing!\nMy skin was glowing after the treatment and I had very little redness.\nYou also receive an extremely relaxing neck, scalp, hand and foot massage that is included in the facial while you have the mask on your face. The experience you get with Elise is phenomenal. She is so professional and extremely knowledgeable.\nI can’t wait to do this again!\nThank you Elise!",
        "time": 1743430093,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sadia Haque",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102089643839732428347/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXkVbhg3gysZx4pYdZ76babUJ7quMYKKEWpugYi16HAvlsFZKsx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Elise always provides amazing care. I absolutely love the services that she provides, I have had manicures, pedicures, waxing, eyebrow shaping, and different types of skin care services. She is meticulous, has a very high standard for hygiene and quality and she is such a great person!",
        "time": 1743545381,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Mathieu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111225358899997665730/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDwgQMbpDo_ud2zTPnj__fYmaw4spW1-jcpQ84FrkIYliBAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "OMG Elise is the best. The kindest and sweetest. I'm leaving for the south tomorrow for my wedding and she came to my rescue at the last minute after my other esthetician cancelled on me. I can't recommend her highly enough; she does so many different treatments and always explains them so well! She's simply the best. 🤩",
        "time": 1763495927,
        "translated": true
      },
